{{Term/Store|Energetic Rhino Beetle|Energetic Rhino Beetles|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Energetic Rhino Beetle}}
Energetic Rhino Beetles can be throughout the [[Akkala Highlands]] and [[West Necluda]], particularly on [[Tree]]s near [[South Akkala Stable]] and on pillars in [[Kakariko Village]]. They are also sold by the [[Traveling Merchant]] [[Bugut]], who walks the road between [[Dueling Peaks Stable]] and Kakariko Village. Combining them in a [[Cooking Pot]] with [[Monster Part]]s will result in an [[Energizing Elixir]], which grants [[Stamina Restoration]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> The [[Kochi Dye Shop]] can use Energetic Rhino Beetles as ingredients for [[Yellow Dye]].

When [[Link]] speaks to [[Beedle]] with at least one Energetic Rhino Beetle in his [[Inventory]], Beedle will notice and beg to have it.<ref name="BotW Beedle"/> He offers [[Meal]]s or [[Elixir]]s as a trade.<ref name="BotW Beedle 2"/> If Link accepts, Beedle will be happy, as he considers finding an Energetic Rhino Beetle to be a good omen.<ref name="BotW Beedle 3"/> When Link speaks to Beedle afterwards, he claims to still be excited about the Energetic Rhino Beetle.<ref name="BotW Beedle 4"/> He claims that if Link has another, he should give it to him tomorrow, as he is going to be focusing on his new Energetic Rhino Beetle for the rest of the day.<ref name="BotW Beedle 5"/> If Link refuses the trade, Beedle cannot understand his reasoning, as he believes the Energetic Rhino Beetle wants to be with him.<ref name="BotW Beedle 6"/> Beedle then quietly schemes to have someone sneak into Link's Inventory and replace his Energetic Rhino Beetle with a more common one.<ref name="BotW Beedle 7"/> Noticing Link is still listening, he asks Link to let him know if he changes his mind.<ref name="BotW Beedle 8"/>

Energetic Rhino Beetles are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|BotW|Energetic Rhino Beetle}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Energetic Rhino Beetle}}
Energetic Rhino Beetles can be found on [[Tree]]s on both the [[Sky Island]]s and on the [[Surface]].

Energetic Rhino Beetles are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|TotK|Energetic Rhino Beetle}}

